codex
The quick synthetic run produced non-finite values because my ad hoc random weights were unit-scale and the FP16 triangular accumulation overflows easily at that scale. The hidden evaluator already handled the previous FP16 path, so I’m using the blackbox for correctness on realistic test setup.
